<li>Omnichannel Retail pilot: one journey, one holdout, thirty-day read.</li>
<li>At day thirty, review omnichannel retail margin, complaints, unsubscribes, repeat buying.</li>
<li>Scale omnichannel retail only once a second operator edits safely.</li>
